  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As Magnet is approaching toward the loop magnetic flux increases and Rate of increment of flux also increases so emf increases with time</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2fc19aff-772e-4b46-9a09-d6f7284318cf-image.png\" style=\"width: 175px; height: 195px;\" />&nbsp;at this moment emf is maximum and negative</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f4730ae7-2121-496a-a636-820ae0b1ae6c-image.png\" style=\"width: 211px; height: 190px;\" />&nbsp;Magnet is in middle of coil, at this moment emf is equal to zero</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8cee5c32-e558-48e4-a7f2-7d3d4c0018cd-image.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 196px;\" />&nbsp;Now again flux start changing however polarity of emf get reverse</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c5ae7610-8b4b-4c1b-a5bd-6bf0a8de319b-image.png\" style=\"width: 185px; height: 219px;\" />&nbsp;At this moment emf is again maximum</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e4a1ff39-9ab8-4d5d-b298-a00292dcbc24-image.png\" style=\"width: 229px; height: 188px;\" />&nbsp;emf again become zero</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/16fe1ffe-6580-41b9-aca4-066f4345a16d-image.png\" style=\"width: 341px; height: 229px;\" /></p>",
